{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Rescue Boggies!</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of most stages in a given location is to rescue all of the stray Boggies. Bring them to the Boggie Door to save them &amp; get them on the path back to their homes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.poster.avif?t=1759790322\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.webm?t=1759790322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.mp4?t=1759790322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dig Holes!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty iron shovel to dig holes in the dirt to trap enemies, take shortcuts, or reach inaccessible areas! You can't dig through rock though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.poster.avif?t=1759790322\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.webm?t=1759790322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.mp4?t=1759790322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that the Boggies are safe, you must save yourself next. Be careful out there on your way to the Exit Door! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.poster.avif?t=1759790322\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.webm?t=1759790322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.mp4?t=1759790322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Best Friends Don't Let Each Other Down.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put retirement aside. Your good boy needs you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exactly As You Do!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2450290/2031642d95fbe10c5518251a388b2305e292be33.jpg"},{"name":"Do It Again, I Wasn't Looking!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2450290/7a1c5b6decbf56ad5a52a51426b8f3457c1a1c36.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Darkness...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2450290/bd88b42afad1e26f07f4c8ec68e5b161ce8fcbd7.jpg"},{"name":"How Tough Are Ya?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2450290/d9c73fc13ffe7ca69aebfc80640640db74b41f3c.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Do the Crime If You Can't Do the Time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2450290/8cd7e65b2835812547a071440135f8b615050c6a.jpg"},{"name":"Firmly Grasp It!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2450290/8f9162c5d3519923a8ea8b67fb9ca30cdc406c47.jpg"},{"name":"Open Sesame!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.